[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0445","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0445.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0260","title":"多款Web服务器 jj CGI程序 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"jj CGI 程序存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向该 CGI 程序传递包含 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等）的特制请求参数，在目标服务器上以 Web 服务器进程权限执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响早期运行 jj CGI 程序的 Unix/Linux 系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议禁用或移除受影响的 jj CGI 脚本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0260"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1996-12-24T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:01Z","remediation":"立即删除 jj CGI 脚本（通常位于 /cgi-bin/jj 路径），该脚本已过时且不适用于现代 Web 服务环境。如因兼容性必须使用，请在 Web 服务器配置中限制 CGI 执行权限并启用输入过滤，但最安全的做法是完全移除该 CGI 程序。同时审查服务器上其他 CGI 脚本是否存在类似 shell 元字符注入问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0260","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/297eb115816d3735806f02ee33bb4d2d53ecd5c6/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0260.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0260","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0260.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0260.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2ed73314b4d66512efbb22e0644e615bc00001f2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0260.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/49899a53e9c2e620c99e0234afe3c50e512ad851/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vqmv-6xp5-qh75/GHSA-vqmv-6xp5-qh75.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/J/jj.nasl","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/slacker247/GPDA/blob/fa9006d0877a691f1ddffe88799c844a3e8a669a/Sodi/Run/IDSrules/rule.1183"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0445.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1232","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1232.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1026","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":16341,\"outputTokens\":44,\"totalTokens\":16385}}","description":"Solaris 7.0 (Solaris 2.5 x86) 的 aspppd 守护进程存在不安全的临时文件创建漏洞，攻击者可通过对 /tmp/.asppp.fifo 文件发起符号链接攻击，将任意文件重定向为指向关键系统文件的符号链接，从而实现任意文件修改并提升至 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.5 x86 平台（即 Solaris 7.0），攻击者需具备本地用户权限即可发起攻击，利用方式为在 aspppd 创建临时文件前预先创建指向敏感文件（如 /etc/passwd 或 /etc/shadow）的符号链接，诱导进程以 root 权限写入或修改目标文件，最终导致权限提升至 root。CVSS 评分 7.2，属于高危本地提权漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1026"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1996-12-20T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:33Z","remediation":"建议立即为受影响的 Solaris 2.5 x86 系统打上 Sun 官方补丁包（如 103630 系列 aspppd 补丁），或升级至已修复的 Solaris 2.6 及更高版本。若暂无法打补丁，可临时禁用 aspppd 服务（删除 /etc/rc2.d 中相关启动脚本或停用 aspppd），并以 root 权限手动创建受保护的 /tmp/.asppp.fifo 文件（chmod 600 且归属 root）以阻止符号链接攻击，同时限制普通用户对 /tmp 的写权限作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420343&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/292","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19233","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7e65fa522cff0172990568230ff9b719b8650296/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1026.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1026","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1026.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7aedbd0209e609a1924ad29a8dda684737576137/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1026.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5d945305f2cad48b7bb06af582393a58c31555d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fff7-q3gj-wjm6/GHSA-fff7-q3gj-wjm6.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1026.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154600_154700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--aaaedcbc-195c-441d-9583-ccdc7d25a142.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1232.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1487","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1487.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1385","title":"FreeBSD ppp 本地缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 2.1 及更早版本中的 ppp 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 HOME 环境变量传入超长字符串触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而获取提升的权限。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 2.1 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1385"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:19Z","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD 系统至 2.1.5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 ppp 程序对 HOME 环境变量的缓冲区边界检查。如无法升级，可移除 ppp 程序的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/ppp），限制本地普通用户执行 ppp 的提权路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420332&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7465.php","http://www.osvdb.org/6085","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b8e5ca8c68c148c2498e70421f33344e9cff1e8/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1385.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1385","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1385.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/376d7933ee02aeea89711d9c7726aad7f10e0a2a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1385.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-7vpf-cwcr-569g/GHSA-7vpf-cwcr-569g.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83049/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1385.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3753b2ba-17e8-4548-ba12-2fef373646dd.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1487.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0275","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0275.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0127","title":"HP HP-UX SD-UX 本地任意文件写入权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 系统的 SD-UX 软件包中的 swinstall 和 swmodify 命令存在任意文件写入漏洞，本地低权限用户可通过符号链接攻击或直接指定路径的方式，在系统任意位置创建或覆盖文件，从而将恶意内容写入敏感系统文件（如 /etc/passwd），最终提升至 root 权限。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 多个版本，攻击者需拥有本地 shell 访问权限方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0127"],"sources":["avd","cve"],"published":"1996-12-19T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"HP-UX SD-UX 已停止安全维护，建议升级到受支持的操作系统版本。若仍使用 HP-UX，应从 HP IT Resource Center 获取 PHCO 安全补丁包进行修复，或移除 swinstall 和 swmodify 命令的 setuid 位，限制仅授权管理员可执行，并启用文件完整性监控（如 Tripwire）检测异常文件写入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0127","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0127"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0275.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0277","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0277.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0128","title":"Linux Kernel ICMP Ping 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux Kernel 1.3.0 及 2.0 版本中存在 ICMP 数据包处理缺陷，远程攻击者可通过向目标主机发送特制的大尺寸 ICMP Ping 数据包（超过 65535 字节）触发内核缓冲区溢出，导致系统崩溃或重启，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞即经典的 \"Ping of Death\"（死亡之 ping），攻击条件简单，危害范围广泛，影响同期众多操作系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0128"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1996-12-18T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:39Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.0.23 或更高版本，该版本已修复 ICMP 分片重组时未校验包大小的问题。若无法升级内核，可在防火墙层面过滤分片 ICMP Echo Request 包（如 iptables 规则禁止入站分片 ICMP 包）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0128"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0277.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1327","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1327.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1089","title":"HP-UX chfn 命令缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 9.X 至 10.20 版本中的 chfn 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 chfn 命令行参数传递超长字符串触发栈缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖返回地址并执行任意代码，最终获取 root 权限。该漏洞源于 chfn 程序未对用户输入进行充分长度检查，导致攻击者能够以提升的权限执行恶意指令，完全控制系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1089"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1996-12-13T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到已修复的 HP-UX 版本或应用厂商提供的安全补丁。由于该漏洞影响 HP-UX 9.X 至 10.20 版本，建议升级到 10.20 之后的修复版本，或参考 CIAC 公告 h-16 和 h-21 获取补丁详情。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/h-16.shtml","http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/h-21.shtml","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602167420285&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2008"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1327.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0493","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0493.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0297","title":"Vixie Cron 库缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Vixie Cron 库 3.0 及更早版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向受影响的 cron 守护进程提交特制的超长环境变量，触发栈缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖返回地址并劫持程序执行流。成功利用此漏洞可获得目标系统的 root 权限，完全控制主机。该漏洞影响 Vixie Cron 3.0 及之前版本，需具有本地访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0297"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-12-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:05Z","remediation":"立即升级 Vixie Cron 至 3.0pl1 或更高版本，该版本已修复环境变量缓冲区溢出漏洞。现代 Linux 发行版应确保使用 cronie 替代（如安装 cronie 包），或通过系统包管理器更新 cron 至最新版本。临时缓解措施包括限制不可信用户的本地登录访问，以及使用 SELinux/AppArmor 限制 cron 守护进程的权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0297"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0493.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0232","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0232.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0101","title":"IBM AIX/Microsoft Windows/Sun SunOS gethostbyname() 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"AIX 3.x/4.x、Windows 95/98/2000/NT 4.0 及 SunOS 5 等操作系统的 `gethostbyname()` 库函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送恶意的 DNS 主机名解析请求触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响多个主流操作系统平台，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，对核心服务器和网络设备危害极大。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0101"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1996-12-10T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:35Z","remediation":"受影响系统均已停止安全技术支持，建议立即升级至厂商仍在支持的最新操作系统版本。AIX 用户应升级至 AIX 7.2 及以上；Solaris 用户升级至 Solaris 11.4；Windows 平台已无法通过官方补丁修复，须迁移至 Windows 10/11 或 Server 2016+。临时缓解措施：在网络边界防火墙或 DNS 服务器上过滤恶意 DNS 响应数据包，限制应用程序对 gethostbyname() 的输入长度。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/h-13.shtml","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22251","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34851454a7b07498072de47d56f63daa4a4f524d/1999/CVE-1999-0101.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5917e2b15694e167c1fd9ad85775b2bdfc5fe29c/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0101.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0101","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0101.json","https://github.com/doodad-labs/threat-intelligence/blob/ee308632cd35c3a8b60a89f181457ce4fae96eed/data/exploits/CVE-1999-0101.22251.sh","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a55bddfc5dd568e972e08b703ab596ed3580b7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0101.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b69cf2313f68e29acceed58f52f6109cd37bb04/README.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/49899a53e9c2e620c99e0234afe3c50e512ad851/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2q9f-93v8-w2pf/GHSA-2q9f-93v8-w2pf.json","https://github.com/kylekirkby/Python-Exploit-Search-Tool/blob/8e84b77a6ff689ce32d04884f9ea75de04ae0433/platforms/multiple/remote/22251.sh","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0232.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0232.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0226","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0226.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0096","title":"Sendmail Sendmail 任意文件覆盖漏洞","description":"Sendmail邮件服务器的 decode 别名存在安全缺陷，远程攻击者可向 decode 别名发送邮件，利用 Sendmail 将邮件内容通过管道传递给程序执行，从而覆盖系统敏感文件。该漏洞影响配置了 decode 别名的 Sendmail 服务器（常见于 BSD 系统），攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:P/A:N），主要影响文件完整性，可导致敏感文件被篡改或覆盖。攻击者只需向目标发送特制邮件至 decode 别名即可触发漏洞，利用方式为构造恶意邮件内容通过管道机制覆盖关键系统文件。建议禁用或限制 decode 别名，升级至修复版本的 Sendmail。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0096"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"1996-12-10T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:34Z","remediation":"tags, [3] avoiding additional explanations or oblique references.<value>升级Sendmail到8.13.0或更高版本以修复解码别名漏洞，并禁用过时的'decode'别名功能，同时添加邮件头部验证以防止恶意电子邮件通过该别名提交。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/122&type=0&nav=sec.sba","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0096.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0096","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-1999-0096.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0096.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/672.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x3w7-5p4x-x8g9/GHSA-x3w7-5p4x-x8g9.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/sendmail_decode.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x81000/80172/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0096.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0226.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0113","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0113.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0045","title":"Apache/NCSA/Netscape Web服务器 nph-test-cgi脚本任意文件列表漏洞","description":"Apache 1.1、NCSA HTTPd 1.5.2 及 Netscape Server 1.12/1.1/2.0 等早期 Web 服务器默认安装的 nph-test-cgi 脚本未对用户请求进行充分过滤，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向该脚本发送特制请求，遍历并列出服务器上的任意文件目录，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响多个主流 Web 服务器早期版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商建议移除 nph-test-cgi 脚本或升级至不受影响版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0045"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1996-12-10T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:26Z","remediation":"立即删除或禁用 nph-test-cgi 脚本（该脚本仅用于测试，不应部署在生产环境）；升级 Apache 至 2.4 及以上版本（1.3 系列已终止支持，1.1 含多个安全漏洞）；如使用 NCSA HTTPd，建议迁移至 Apache 2.4；Netscape Enterprise Server 用户应升级至 Oracle iPlanet Web Server 7.0+；同时在 Web 服务器配置中禁止 CGI 目录执行任意文件读取操作，严格控制 CGI 脚本文件权限为 750。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0045","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19536","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab6ab436962e16237b21ed9d4458dafc38c692fc/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0045.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0045","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0045.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0045.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37da04e8698400cbfe936368ce494fc186159eb4/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0045.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1b2e09705f0816776a0a8a0cd6fc1208d25f09b2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h7h3-hmx5-3w4r/GHSA-h7h3-hmx5-3w4r.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/0xxx/cve-1999-0045.yaml","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/9e4b769742ed57395763142c26029c2f9910f15b/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0045.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0113.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0113.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0113.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1495","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1495.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1401","title":"SGI IRIX Desktop searchbook 不安全文件权限漏洞","description":"IRIX 5.0.x 至 6.2 版本的 Desktop searchbook 程序存在不安全的文件权限设置漏洞。该程序在安装或运行过程中将用户文件（iconbook 和 searchbook）设置为全局可读写权限，导致本地普通用户可读取或修改其他用户的敏感配置数据。攻击者利用此漏洞可提升权限或窃取用户信息，影响 IRIX 桌面环境的机密性和完整性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1401"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-12-05T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:21Z","remediation":"立即安装 SGI 安全公告 19961201-01-PX 提供的补丁，或升级 IRIX 至 6.2 以上版本。如无法打补丁，手动执行 chmod 600 ~/.iconbook ~/.searchbook 限制文件权限，仅允许所有者读写。对于仍在运行 IRIX 的系统，建议迁移至受支持的平台，因 IRIX 已停止维护多年。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7575.php","http://www.osvdb.org/8563","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/463","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/41de94138b7cf6e858138ec4e79e16fbec611fa4/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1401.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1401","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1401.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/175fba1f481a7f7cf5bdb5344d3c0e47af1884ef/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1401.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa37ed0317ce1265b487f92916077b9ccbfe3349/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-h6x2-q6rh-5pgx/GHSA-h6x2-q6rh-5pgx.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/463/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8b5cebee-1134-40a0-965f-c656f7a52301.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000114.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1401.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1495.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0120","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0120.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0043","title":"INN innd 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"INN (InterNetNews) 新闻服务器守护进程 innd 1.5 版本存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向服务器发送特制的 \"newgroup\" 和 \"rmgroup\" 等控制消息，在消息中注入 shell 元字符，从而在目标服务器上以 innd 进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响运行 INN 1.5 的 Unix 类系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0043"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1996-12-04T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:26Z","remediation":"立即升级 INN (InterNetNews) 至 1.6 或更高版本，该版本修复了控制消息 (newgroup/rmgroup) 中 shell 元字符注入问题。如无法升级，可在 innd.conf 中禁用控制消息处理 (e.g., `allownewgroups: false`、`allowrmgroups: false`)，并在防火墙层面限制对 NNTP 端口 (119/tcp) 的访问，仅允许可信来源连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0043"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0120.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0278","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0278.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0129","title":"Sendmail Sendmail .forward 和 :include: 文件本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Sendmail 在处理 .forward 或 :include: 配置文件时存在权限校验缺陷，本地攻击者可利用该漏洞通过精心构造的配置文件写入任意文件，从而获取目标系统的组权限。该漏洞在默认配置下即可触发，攻击者无需特殊权限。影响 BSD 系列操作系统及使用 Sendmail 的其他 Unix 类系统，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0129"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1996-12-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:39Z","remediation":"升级 Sendmail 至 8.8.4 或更高版本，该版本禁止使用全局可写的 .forward 和 :include: 文件。确保用户主目录及 .forward 文件的权限设置为 755 和 644 或更严格，:include: 引用的文件不得为其他用户可写。如无法升级，可在 sendmail.cf 中添加 O DontBlameSendmail=forwardfilegroupwritable,includeifgroupwritable 等安全限制作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1996-25.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0278.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0110","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0110.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0044","title":"SGI IRIX fsdump 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 6.2 操作系统中 fsdump 命令存在本地权限提升漏洞。由于 fsdump 在处理敏感文件时未能正确限制普通用户的访问权限，本地攻击者可通过修改系统敏感文件将自身权限提升为 root 超级用户，从而完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 6.2 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0044"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1996-12-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:26Z","remediation":"升级至 SGI IRIX 6.3 及以上版本以修复 fsdump 权限提升漏洞。临时缓解措施：执行 `chmod u-s /usr/sbin/fsdump` 移除 fsdump 的 setuid 位，阻止非授权用户以 root 权限运行；同时通过 `chmod 700 /usr/sbin/fsdump` 限制仅 root 用户可执行，防止本地用户提权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19280","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2765cfa5d0fc39151c354509f5ba2b7abfdb61de/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0044.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0044","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0044.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0044.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37da04e8698400cbfe936368ce494fc186159eb4/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0044.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0044.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d1211931-bc17-4b72-a817-dc1a2d02bd86.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0110.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0135","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0135.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0050","title":"HP HP-UX newgrp 本地缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 10.20 系统中的 `newgrp` 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向该程序提交特制参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 10.20 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限方可利用此漏洞进行提权。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0050"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1996-12-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:27Z","remediation":"建议立即为 HP-UX 10.20 安装 HP 官方补丁 PHCO_13542（或更高版本的累积补丁束），替换存在溢出缺陷的 newgrp 程序。若暂时无法打补丁，可通过命令 `chmod u-s /usr/bin/newgrp` 移除该程序的 setuid 位作为临时缓解，并限制普通用户访问，同时加强审计日志监控对 newgrp 的异常调用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0050","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19535","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab6ab436962e16237b21ed9d4458dafc38c692fc/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0050.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0050","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0050.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0050.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37da04e8698400cbfe936368ce494fc186159eb4/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0050.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1b2e09705f0816776a0a8a0cd6fc1208d25f09b2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f29h-343h-g8gj/GHSA-f29h-343h-g8gj.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0050.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--89a6ac85-e7f6-4f7a-9588-810221d536e3.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0135.toml"}]